    "content": "ARCHITECTURAL DECISION RECORD // ADR-EDA-01: Complete LLM Exclusion from Physics\nCase Study: CS-02 (EDA CAD: Deterministic Calculus vs OpenCascade BRep CAD Solid Mass Properties & Anti-Hallucination Materials Policy)\nProject ID: proj-design-automation (Slug: design-automation)\nStatus: ACCEPTED\nAnchor: #adr-eda-01\nPublication Eligibility: PUBLIC_OPEN_SOURCE\n\nDecision & Technical Details:\nRestrict LLMs strictly to extracting requirements (speed, power, torque) with character span offsets. All physical calculations are executed by deterministic Python classes (`ShaftTorsionSolver`) implementing closed-form textbook equations.\n\nMANDATORY GOVERNANCE CAVEATS:\n• Measures software-calculus mathematical agreement between closed-form physics equations and OpenCascade CAD solid kernel mass integrals. Does NOT assert physical CNC machining or manufacturing tolerance.",
