    "id": "chunk-kb-adr-rel-01",
    "content": "ARCHITECTURAL DECISION RECORD // ADR-REL-01: Multi-Modal Evidence via Headless Chromium\nCase Study: CS-04 (AI Application Reliability: Fisher Information Covariance-Based Abstention & Cryptographic Human Authorization)\nProject ID: proj-ai-reliability (Slug: ai-reliability)\nStatus: ACCEPTED\nAnchor: #adr-rel-01\nPublication Eligibility: PUBLIC_OPEN_SOURCE\n\nDecision & Technical Details:\nReject synthetic DOM mocks. Execute real headless Chromium browser sessions via Playwright capturing multi-modal artifacts (DOM snapshots, full-page PNG screenshots, network HAR traces).\n\nMANDATORY GOVERNANCE CAVEATS:\n• Represents collected pytest test cases and parameterized checks across backend/tests/ in external repository (aadil-lang/ai-application-reliability). Unexecuted in this local repository. Strictly individual test cases, NOT 158 distinct test suite files.",
