    "id": "chunk-kb-adr-rel-04",
    "content": "ARCHITECTURAL DECISION RECORD // ADR-REL-04: SHA-256 Hash-Linked Provenance Ledger\nCase Study: CS-04 (AI Application Reliability: Fisher Information Covariance-Based Abstention & Cryptographic Human Authorization)\nProject ID: proj-ai-reliability (Slug: ai-reliability)\nStatus: ACCEPTED\nAnchor: #adr-rel-04\nPublication Eligibility: PUBLIC_OPEN_SOURCE\n\nDecision & Technical Details:\nEvery tool call, evidence artifact, diagnosis, human approval, and retest is hashed using SHA-256 and chained to the preceding event's hash (`verify_provenance_chain`) stored in SQLite, providing tamper-evident audit linkage (distinct from immutable hardware storage).\n",
