    "id": "chunk-kb-adr-solace-02",
    "content": "ARCHITECTURAL DECISION RECORD // ADR-SOLACE-02: Deterministic Keyword Crisis Safety Screening\nCase Study: CS-05 (Solace AI: Cross-Platform Real-Time Voice Streaming & Application-Level Audio Buffer Handling)\nProject ID: proj-solace-ai (Slug: solace-ai)\nStatus: ACCEPTED\nAnchor: #adr-solace-02\nPublication Eligibility: PUBLIC_OPEN_SOURCE\n\nDecision & Technical Details:\nGenerative LLMs must not be relied upon to detect acute self-harm emergencies. A deterministic keyword/pattern-based screening layer intercepts queries matching predefined distress terms and routes to designated crisis contact numbers. This is a pattern-matching safety heuristic, not comprehensive or guaranteed crisis detection, and external helpline verification or geographic routing appropriateness has not been established in implementation evidence.\n\nMANDATORY GOVERNANCE CAVEATS:\n• Recorded in React Native Jest test runners in external repository (aadil-lang/solace-ai). Unexecuted in this local repository. Does NOT represent physical Android mobile device hardware or emulator execution.",
