    "id": "chunk-kb-pattern-04",
    "content": "CROSS-PROJECT ENGINEERING PATTERN 04 // Separation of Reasoning from Authorization\nPattern ID: PATTERN-04\nCategory: Recurring Architectural Principle\nSource: research/engineering/ENGINEERING_EXPERIENCE_KNOWLEDGE_BASE_DRAFT.md#cross-project-patterns\n\nDescription & Engineering Implementations:\nMaintaining an architectural separation between an agent's ability to reason or recommend and its authority to perform consequential actions. AI Reliability documents application-level authorization-token gating through ChangeAuthorizationService; Ask Aadil uses human-in-the-loop action governance and draft-integrity controls. These are distinct implementations and should not be presented as equivalent authorization mechanisms.\n",
